| **`LGA-07`: `SafetyNOC`** (`/protocols/lga-governance-stack/lga-07-safety-noc`) | Fourth Schedule Para 1(e) & (h): Slaughter slabs, abattoir hygiene, and market fire-safety clearances. | **Cluster 6 (Market Associations/Abattoirs) & Cluster 3 (Environmental Health Officers):** Uninspected abattoirs and market fire hazards; fake paper clearance certificates (`MECH-05`). | • **Attestation:** Time-bounded `SureEvidence` Fire & Environmental Health No-Objection Certificate with mandatory geo-stamped inspection photos. |
| **`LGA-08`: `WardWorks`** (`/protocols/lga-governance-stack/lga-08-ward-works`) | Fourth Schedule Para 1(f): Construction and maintenance of feeder roads, drains, street lighting, and ward halls. | **Cluster 3 (LGA Councils/Auditors) & Cluster 7 (Civic Researchers):** Ghost ward projects and payments for unexecuted feeder-road grading (`MECH-05`, `MECH-07`). | • **Disbursement Gate:** Links OCDS procurement contract ID to offline geo-fenced before/after photo hashes (`SureEvidence`) before `SplitDirect` releases milestone payment. |
| **`LGA-09`: `TenementRate`** (`/protocols/lga-governance-stack/lga-09-tenement-rate`) | Fourth Schedule Para 1(j): Assessment of privately owned houses or tenements for levying rates. | **Cluster 3 (LGA Revenue Officers) & Cluster 6 (Landlords):** Arbitrary manual assessments, un-mapped properties, and cash diversion by collectors (`MECH-02`, `MECH-07`). | • **Cadastre:** Deterministic rate calculation bound to `LandGuard` parcel polygon (`IND-17`) and paid strictly via `SplitDirect` (`platform_escrow_amount_kobo == 0`) directly to the LGA Treasury Account. |
