| **`LGA-11`: `WardPHC`** (`/protocols/lga-governance-stack/lga-11-ward-phc`) | Fourth Schedule Para 2(c): Provision and maintenance of Primary Health Care (PHC) services, immunization, and SMC campaigns. | **Cluster 6 (Mothers/Infants) & Cluster 3 (PHC Officers):** Paper tally sheets lost in rural wards; stockouts of malaria/vaccine commodities (`MECH-02`, `MECH-06`). | • **Micro-Planning:** Offline `KioskBase` ward household enumeration and `NDHX` HL7 FHIR immunization/SMC administration log (expanding the verified Kebbi State 21-LGA baseline nationwide). |
