| **`LGA-13`: `CustomaryDocket`** (`/protocols/lga-governance-stack/lga-13-customary-docket`) | Customary, Area, and District Courts operating at the LGA level across the 36 States \+ FCT. | **Cluster 1 (Area/Customary Court Clerks), Cluster 2 (Counsel) & Cluster 6 (Litigants):** 100% paper record-keeping; missing records of appeal to State High Courts; risk of leaking sensitive family/inheritance disputes (`MECH-05`, `MECH-06`). | • **Privacy-First Bridge:** Offline `KioskBase` docket intake that locks matrimonial, custody, and minor files inside `INTERNAL_RESTRICTED_NDPA` (PostgreSQL 17 `FORCE RLS`) while issuing s. 84 QR-sealed CTCs for appellate transmission. |
